WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.922
Hello! Greetings from morning to night.

2
00:00:04.372 --> 00:00:05.719
It's seven a.m.

3
00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:08.073
Good morning, Anna! How are you?

4
00:00:08.523 --> 00:00:10.427
I'm fine, thank you. And you?

5
00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:12.177
I'm great, thanks!

6
00:00:14.427 --> 00:00:16.378
It's three p.m. at the office.

7
00:00:16.828 --> 00:00:18.917
Good afternoon! I'm Paul. Nice to meet you.

8
00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.668
Nice to meet you too, Paul.

9
00:00:22.918 --> 00:00:24.822
It's eight p.m. at a restaurant.

10
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:27.036
Good evening! How are you doing?

11
00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:29.716
Good evening! I'm doing well, thank you.

12
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:33.359
It's eleven p.m.

13
00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:36.409
OK, I'm going to bed now. Good night!

14
00:00:36.859 --> 00:00:38.206
Good night! Take care!

